{"unit_id":"lolipop-1x1__dsh-you-should-know#card-zh","repo":"lolipop-1x1/dsh-you-should-know","commit":"ca2af97fefb0a1ebb436dd23d8f0bbf615cceb61","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"You Should Know（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在任务进行时观察主会话，并把可能影响理解或决策的重要事实与方案取舍作为提醒显示在输入框附近。它通过宿主模型请求扩展点获取会话上下文，在后台按模型步骤间隔检查；用户可以展开解释、标记已了解、关闭提醒，或把内容带回主会话。设置支持选择语言、观察模型、检查间隔和每轮次数，并保存跨会话主题记录。适合希望在 DSH 执行任务时留意关键背景的用户。需要 Harness 已配置的模型服务；观察会额外发送上下文并产生模型调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:69-91","src/host/engine.ts:130-180","src/client/index.tsx:127-180"]}
{"unit_id":"lolipop-1x1__dsh-you-should-know#card-en","repo":"lolipop-1x1/dsh-you-should-know","commit":"ca2af97fefb0a1ebb436dd23d8f0bbf615cceb61","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"You Should Know (DSH Web plugin) surfaces key facts and trade-offs during tasks. Background checks place notes near the input; users can expand, mark, or return them to chat. Settings control language, model, and check limits. Calls use Harness models and conversation context.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:69-91","src/host/engine.ts:130-180","src/client/index.tsx:127-180"]}
