{"unit_id":"lolipop-1x1__dsh-you-should-know#feature-explain","repo":"lolipop-1x1/dsh-you-should-know","commit":"ca2af97fefb0a1ebb436dd23d8f0bbf615cceb61","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"You Should Know 的功能「展开解释」：用户展开提醒后可查看原因与影响；提醒未附可用解释时，插件会基于已捕获的会话请求另行生成解释。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/engine.ts:188-218"]}
