{"unit_id":"lolipop-1x1__dsh-you-should-know#feature-return-note","repo":"lolipop-1x1/dsh-you-should-know","commit":"ca2af97fefb0a1ebb436dd23d8f0bbf615cceb61","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"You Should Know 的功能「带回会话」：用户可将提醒及解释插入主会话输入框继续讨论；若草稿、附件或输入状态不适合插入，插件会保留现有内容并提示用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:95-114"]}
